// Chur -- "Smash: Whenever a player plays a Relic from his or her hand, discard it from play."
// Broadcast onPlay reactor, fires for EITHER side's Relic plays (no "opponent"/"you" qualifier),
// including Chur's own controller's.

import { registerCardEffect } from './registry.js';
import { discardFromPlay } from '../effects.js';

registerCardEffect('Chur', {
  onPlay: (state, cardDb, played, self, rng) => {
    if (cardDb.get(played.definitionKey)?.card_type !== 'Relic') return;
    const owner = state.players.get(played.controllerId);
    if (!owner) return;
    discardFromPlay(state, cardDb, owner, played.instanceId, undefined, undefined, rng);
  },
});
