// "What are my legal moves" -- the seam project-roadmap-and-architecture-notes.md flags for
// future UI/AI/bots to share: "a bot is just something that calls the same 'what are my legal
// moves' / 'apply this move' interface a human's UI does."
//
// Not exhaustive of every action a card's free text might unlock (that's the §14 long tail) --
// covers the base-rules actions the engine actually knows how to execute: attacking, using a
// numeric-cost Power, playing a card from hand, and advancing the phase.

