// purpose-built decks that reproduce it exactly under GameState.tutorialMode's no-shuffle
// guarantee (see setup.ts/zones.ts). Deck card order below IS draw order, permanently -- every
// position past the front-loaded "critical" cards is unconstrained filler, but the first several
// positions are deliberately arranged so the scripted turns' searches/draws land on exactly the
// cards the transcript names, with zero reliance on a seed that merely happens to work out.

